        "title": "Default agentic CPC set to 300 cents in agentic pool",
        "summary": "`common/src/ads/agentic-pool.ts` introduces `DEFAULT_AGENTIC_CPC_CENTS` set to 300 cents as the starting price for new agentic campaigns, and rebases the existing `AGENTIC_TIER2_ACCEPT_PRICE_CENTS` ceiling onto that new constant. The reassignment is a pure constant swap, so the TIER 2 accept price now tracks whatever the default CPC becomes, but the diff shows no consumer of `DEFAULT_AGENTIC_CPC_CENTS` in this revision. The advertiser console consumes `AGENTIC_TIER2_ACCEPT_PRICE_CENTS` to explain why an effective CPC sits below the list CPC.",
