        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The default starting price for new agentic advertising campaigns has been set to 300 cents (or $3.00 per click). The maximum charge for a TIER 2 request was previously a fixed 100 cents, and it now follows this new default price, meaning it will adjust automatically if the default changes in the future. Advertisers will not see a new campaign default appear yet, because nothing in the product currently reads this starting price; the change only prepares the shared settings that both the Freebuff app and the internal ad tools agree on. No action is required from you, and you will not notice anything different.",
