        "acceptedPr": null,
        "calls": 2,
        "title": "Add optional completion check, deadline reminders, and background",
        "summary": "The default base3 agent enables completionCheck, which offers one verification pass after edits using available tools before ending the turn, gated by a remaining step budget and an optional deadline. Packages/agent-runtime/src/run-agent-step.ts implements the gate with a completionCheckpoint that survives transient transport failures, and adds urgency-tiered deadline reminders as time budget expires. The SDK now supports BACKGROUND terminal commands with a new releaseBackgroundTerminalCommands export and persistent log files, and model-provider.ts adds sanitizeByokTransportError plus retry-after propagation for BYOK transport errors. Deadline awareness is threaded through RunOptions.deadlineAt in sdk/src/run.ts, with 11 files changed across agents, shared core types, agent runtime, and SDK.",
